{"meaning_id": "government_00060", "direction": "ne-en", "register": "formal", "surface": "government", "src": "(ङ) कानून सुधार आयोग, २०३६ः कानून आयोग २०२९ को सुझाव सहितको प्रतिवेदन अध्ययन गरी कार्यान्वयन गर्ने तथा तोकिए बमोजिम अन्य कामहरु गर्न पाँचौ पटक मिति २०३६।८।२६ मा कानून सुधार आयोगको गठन भयो । यसको कार्यावधि ३ वर्षको हुने र बैठक कम्तिमा हप्ताको २ पटक वस्ने गरी व्यवस्था गरिएको थियो । तोकिए बमोजिम आयोगको गठनविधि एवं काम, कर्तव्यहरु अनुसूची— ५ मा उल्लेख गरिएको छ । यो आयोगले हदम्याद सम्बन्धी कानूनको मस्यौदा, मुलुकी ऐनको संशोधन मस्यौदा एवं मध्यस्थता सम्बन्धी ऐनको मस्यौदा तयार गरी पेश गरेको थियो । आयोगको पदावधि मिति २०३९।८।२२ मा समाप्त भएपनि अर्को व्यवस्था नभएसम्मका लागि यो आयोगलाई साविक बमोजिमको जिम्मेवारी थप गरिएको थियो ।", "mix_reference": "To draft new legislation and amendment of the statute with explanatory notes, To codify, unify and review existing laws, To draft legislation to include treaty obligation, To exchange ideas and information with law commissions and law drafting agencies of other countries, To carry out study and research works on legal field. To make consultation with stakeholders, To obtain expert service. To prepare annual programs and annual progress report, To accomplish other functions relating to law and justice as prescribed by the Government and as deemed necessary by the Commission itself, To make necessary recommendation to the Government. Process of Discussion on Consultation Paper", "base": "Law Reforms Commission, 2036: Law Commission to study and implement the report containing the suggestions of 2029 and to perform other functions as prescribed. The Law Reforms Commission was constituted on 2036-26 for the fifth time. It had a tenure of 3 years and meeting at least twice a week. The constitution and functions, duties, and functions of the Commission as prescribed are mentioned in Schedule V. The Commission prepared and submitted the draft of the law relating to recognition, the", "e1": "Law Reform Commission, 2036: Law Commission to study and implement the report containing suggestions for 2029 and to carry out other work as prescribed The Law Reform Commission was constituted for the fifth time on 26.036.2036. It has a tenure of 3 years and meeting at least twice a week. The Commission is constituted as per the prescribed rules and functions, duties are mentioned in Schedule V. The Commission prepared and submitted the draft of the law relating to recognition, amendment of the", "decode": {"max_new_tokens": 96, "num_beams": 1, "do_sample": false}, "review_status": "unapproved"}
